From 52a1e5b0d514e7e3162635b3d673aa0cd290b837 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 21:43:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] feat(uc-compat): Unity Catalog-compatible API foundation

Add /api/2.1/unity-catalog router with UC error envelope, pagination
helpers, and Catalogs (read-only warehouse mapping) + Schemas (top-level
namespace CRUD) endpoints. Schemas delegate to the existing Iceberg
NamespaceService handlers so authorization, idempotency and authorizer
tuples behave identically. Gated by enable_uc_compat_api (default on).
